  "businessType": "Accommodation",
  "businessDescription": "<p>Hotel Yogiraj NX in Shirdi offers comfortable accommodation for families, couples, and travellers. The hotel features well-maintained air-conditioned rooms with private bathrooms, work desks, TVs, and free Wi-Fi to ensure a pleasant stay. Guests can enjoy delicious meals at the on-site restaurant, offering Asian and vegetarian food along with à la carte breakfast options. The hotel also provides convenient facilities, including a lounge, lift, 24-hour front desk, free private parking, and room service. Additional services such as paid shuttle facilities, car hire, and tour assistance are available for guests. Located in Shirdi, the hotel offers convenient access to the famous Sai Baba Temple and other nearby attractions. With comfortable rooms, dining facilities, and helpful services, Hotel Yogiraj NX is a suitable choice for a relaxing and convenient stay in Shirdi.</p>",
